    ["1345年4月12日 \n第一次摸到父亲的工具。锤子比想象中沉，手抖得厉害，把银片敲变形了。\n\n1345年8月3日 \n学会了辨认红宝石和石榴石的区别。\n\n1346年2月18日 \n母亲咳嗽又重了。周薪涨到12苏勒，买了些润喉的草药。\n\n1346年7月9日 \n独立完成了一枚银戒指的抛光。主顾是个码头工人，给未婚妻的。\n\n1347年3月15日 \n正式成为匠人学徒。父亲说我手稳，适合吃这碗饭。\n\n1347年11月2日 \n学会了镶嵌月光石。父亲点头了。\n\n1348年6月3日 \n周薪涨到1镑5苏勒。母亲炖了肉汤。\n\n1348年9月14日 \n第一次接定制单。顾客要一枚带苹果花纹的胸针，说送给妻子。画了三遍草图才满意。\n\n1349年1月20日 \n整理铺子旧物，发现一张泛黄的家谱图。有些名字被涂掉了。\n\n1349年3月8日 \n母亲的药粉快吃完了。这周多接些修活的单子。\n\n1349年6月28日 \n收到了一本奇怪的笔记。翻开第一页，那些符号……好像在哪里见过。"] = "April 12, 1345 \n First time touching father's tools. The hammer was heavier than expected, my hand shook so much I deformed the silver sheet. \n\n August 3, 1345 \n Learned to distinguish between rubies and garnets. \n\n February 18, 1346 \n Mother's cough worsened. Weekly wage rose to 12 sous, bought some throat-soothing herbs. \n\n July 9, 1346 \n Independently finished polishing a silver ring. The client was a dock worker, for his fiancée. \n\n March 15, 1347 \n Officially became a craftsman's apprentice. Father said my hands are steady, suitable for this trade. \n\n November 2, 1347 \n Learned to set moonstones. Father nodded. \n\n June 3, 1348 \n Weekly wage rose to 1 pound 5 sous. Mother made meat stew. \n\n September 14, 1348 \n First custom order. Customer wanted a brooch with an apple pattern, said it was for his wife. Drew the sketch three times before he was satisfied. \n\n January 20, 1349 \n Sorting through old items in the shop, found a yellowed family tree. Some names were crossed out. \n\n March 8, 1349 \n Mother's herbal powder is almost gone. Need to take more repair jobs this week. \n\n June 28, 1349 \n Received a strange notebook. Opened the first page, those symbols... I feel like I've seen them somewhere.",
