    ["<Assistant_Title1>【神座之争】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>神座之争</>是<Assistant_Red>6对6激情对战</>玩法，最多可组成<Assistant_Red>6人队伍</>参与匹配。玩法内所有玩家采用与玩法外相同的真实属性进行战斗。\n<Assistant_Title2>获胜条件：</>限时内击败敌方队伍内所有玩家即可获胜。若对局时间结束时双方队伍均有成员存活，则依次按照<Assistant_Property1>击败人数</>、<Assistant_Property1>存活人数</>、<Assistant_Property1>伤害总量</>、<Assistant_Property1>存活血量</>判定，数值较高的一方获胜。\n<Assistant_Title2>复活规则：</>在神座之争中，每个队伍拥有<Assistant_Red>2次</>复活死亡队友的机会。\n<Assistant_Title2>开放时间：</>玩法入口显示开放时间为<Assistant_Red>10:00-1:00</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往神座之争]|1250123}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Battle for the Throne of God】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Explanation: </><Assistant_System>Battle for the Throne of God</> is a <Assistant_Red>6v6 intense battle</> mode, where you can form a team of up to <Assistant_Red>6 people</> to participate in matchmaking. All players in this mode use the same real attributes as outside the mode. \n<Assistant_Title2>Victory Conditions: </>Defeat all players on the enemy team within the time limit to win. If both teams have members alive when the time ends, the winner is determined in order by <Assistant_Property1>number of kills</>, <Assistant_Property1>number of survivors</>, <Assistant_Property1>total damage dealt</>, and <Assistant_Property1>remaining HP</>, with the higher value winning. \n<Assistant_Title2>Resurrection Rules: </>In the Battle for the Throne of God, each team has <Assistant_Red>2 opportunities</> to resurrect fallen teammates. \n<Assistant_Title2>Opening Hours: </>The gameplay entrance displays the opening hours as <Assistant_Red>10:00-1:00</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>{JumpToUI:[Go to Battle for the Throne of God]|1250123}",
